OL,3,GNEWSAFormer director admits
OL,4,Amulti-million pound theft at elite
OL,5,ACardiff college
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo people have pleaded guilty to
OL,8,Fcharges relating to a multi-million
OL,9,Fpound fraud at Cardiff Sixth Form
OL,10,FCollege.
OL,12,FFormer director and trustee Nadeem
OL,13,FSarwar from Pentwyn, Cardiff, pleaded
OL,14,Fguilty to stealing a total of not less
OL,15,Fthan #5m between 19 February 2008 and
OL,16,F31 October 2016.
OL,18,FThe 50-year-old admitted to the theft
OL,19,Fcharge during an appearance at Merthyr
OL,20,FCrown Court.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
